  "rationale": "16 units of Full Cream Milk 200G at Outlet 04 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-19; doing nothing writes off ₹648 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹217. This play uses a bundle with SKU-RUSK-200G at ₹96 for 317 consented customers (Personal care regulars, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Tea connoisseurs, Premium Tea regulars, Household essentials buyers): expected 21 units, margin ₹177, discount cost ₹192, waste avoided ₹648 (CI 1 to 62 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs the expiring Full Cream Milk with Rusk 200G at a bundle price of 96 INR, which satisfies the 8% dairy margin floor and recovers 176.6 INR in margin while avoiding waste.",
